        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PDB42, Double Pocket Door Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOne of the few solutions to lock double sliding pocket doors, the Deltana PDB42, Sliding Pocket Door Jamb Bolt is used to lock pocket doors including double (dutch) doors. The Double Pocket Door Lock is mounted on the jamb side of a pocket door and works like a rocker switch. When pushed in the other half pops out, physically preventing the door from going into its pocket. The pocket door jamb bolt features an emergency lock release protector to mount on door exterior. It is packaged with matching finish screws and a strike plate (to protect the jamb) and is available in great finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-PDB42-works.gif?v=1704354524\" width=\"475\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"deltana PDB42 how it works\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<A HREF=\"javascript:newWindow('/site/image_detail.cfm?id=157410',750,650)\">Click Here to view This Jamb Bolt Installed on a Pocket Door</A>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for the Deltana PDB42 Pocket Door Jamb Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Centers: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PDB42.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PDB42 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PDB42-install.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PDB42 Installation Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
