                "title": "Sliding Pocket Door Jamb Bolt, Deltana PDB42",
                "description": "One of the few solutions to lock double sliding pocket doors, the Deltana PDB42, Sliding Pocket Door Jamb Bolt is used to lock pocket doors including double (dutch) doors. The Double Pocket Door Lock is mounted on the jamb side of a pocket door and works like a rocker switch. When pushed in the other half pops out, physically preventing the door from going into its pocket. The pocket door jamb bolt features an emergency lock release protector to mount on door exterior. It is packaged with matching finish screws and a strike plate (to protect the jamb) and is available in great finishes.\r\n",
